<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">YouTube to MP3: A Complete Guide</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Converting YouTube videos to MP3 is useful when you want to save a podcast, lecture, music you created, or royalty-free audio track. This guide explains how to extract audio safely and legally.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">When is it legal to convert YouTube to MP3?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">You are generally allowed to convert content that:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>You created or uploaded yourself.</li>
        <li>Is in the public domain or under a Creative Commons license that permits audio extraction.</li>
        <li>The creator has explicitly allowed downloads.</li>
        <li>YouTube itself provides an offline or download option (e.g., YouTube Premium offline).</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Downloading copyrighted music, movies, or shows without permission is not allowed. See our <a href="/content-policy" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">Content Policy</a> for more.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">How to convert YouTube to MP3</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Go to the YouTube video and copy the URL.</li>
        <li>Open <a href="/mp3" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">our MP3 downloader</a> or paste the URL on the home page.</li>
        <li>Choose an audio-only format such as MP3, M4A, or WAV.</li>
        <li>Click the format card and the audio file will download directly.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Choosing the right audio quality</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">MP3 files come in different bitrates. 128 kbps is fine for speech, 192–256 kbps is good for music, and 320 kbps offers the best quality for MP3. For archival, WAV or FLAC may be better but the file size is much larger.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Common issues and fixes</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li><strong>Long videos fail:</strong> Try a lower bitrate or shorter clip.</li>
        <li><strong>Audio has no sound:</strong> Some formats are video-only. Pick an audio or muxed format.</li>
        <li><strong>Slow conversion:</strong> High-resolution sources take longer. Choose a lower quality.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Final tips</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Always keep a backup of your original files, name them clearly, and store them in a folder that is easy to find. If you plan to use the audio publicly, keep a record of the license or permission.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
